    <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> Watch Out For</h2>
    <p>Common misconceptions to avoid:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Generic Responses: Students often provide general superficial knowledge rather than specific research-backed details.</li>
        <li>Ethics Focus only: Weaker responses focus solely on ethics while ignoring the technical computational complexity.</li>
        <li>Terminology: Misunderstanding terms specific to the annually changing case study (found on the final page of the IB release).</li>
    </ul>
